OL,3,GNEWSAWildlife appeal closes in on #30m
OL,4,Atarget
OL,5,
OL,6,FConservation groups aiming to raise
OL,7,F#30m to buy a vast upland estate are
OL,8,Fwithin touching distance of their
OL,9,Ftarget following a #1.9m government
OL,10,Fpledge.
OL,12,FThe Wildlife Trusts and Northumberland
OL,13,FWildlife Trust are looking to acquire
OL,14,Fthe 9,500-acre Rothbury Estate in its
OL,15,Fentirety as part of plans boost
OL,16,Fwildlife, restore bogs and promote
OL,17,Fnature-friendly farming.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,397,390,260,160,0,100
