OL,3,GNEWSAWildlife appeal closes in on #30m
OL,4,Atarget
OL,5,
OL,6,FTheir fundraising efforts - now
OL,7,Fstanding at #29m thanks to the latest
OL,8,Fdonation - have attracted backing from
OL,9,Fthe likes of Sir David Attenborough
OL,10,Fwith the window for public donations
OL,11,Frunning until the end of this week.
OL,13,FHowever, some members of the
OL,14,FNorthumberland farming community said
OL,15,Fthey viewed the project as "a folly".
